        "review_GJGq9n": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I'm happy with TryScent. The scent smells very close to the original and lasts well. The packaging is nice and the bottle looks great. Overall it's a great alternative if you want a quality fragrance at a reasonable price.\"</p>",
