          }
        },
        "review_j8wKcd": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"After a small delay I finally got my TryScent perfumes and they are spot on! I can hardly believe how similar they are to the originals. For reference I bought \\\"Ylang Ylang Rose Jasmine\\\" and \\\"Aldehydes Rose Sandalwood\\\" and they really are beautiful scents.\"</p>",
            "author": "Gabriella K",
            "date": "7 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": "amalfi-coast-mandarino-di-amalfi-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "review_GPPnxQ": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I'm very happy with the perfume from this brand. It has such a beautiful scent, smells like the original and is cheaper. I will definitely buy it again.\"</p>",
            "author": "Vera",
            "date": "8 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": "6x-30ml-perfume-bottles"
          }
        },
        "review_nJELg9": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"Last summer I got a sample of Creed Aventus as a gift and I really liked it, but I couldn't afford the original so I started looking for dupes. I found TryScent and ordered \\\"Pineapple Smoke Vanilla\\\". I got it in about a week and it smells really good, and very close to my original sample. I'm very happy with the product, especially for the price.\"</p>",
            "author": "Hwan H",
            "date": "8 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "show_verified_badge": true,
            "product": "3x-50ml-perfume-bottles"
          }
        },
        "review_kqR3XT": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I tried their 7.5 ml sample scents and to my surprise I liked them. I've placed a second order and this time I got the bigger bottles. I have to say I got my orders on time and they delivered the scents I like!\"</p>",
            "author": "Lauri E",
            "date": "8 months ago",
